# A real with 60 fraction digits.
tokens: PROGRAM IDENT(P) SEMI CONST IDENT(C) EQ REAL(1.111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111) SEMI BEGIN IDENT(WRITE) LPAREN IDENT(C) RPAREN END DOT
tpc: ok
output: ' 1.1111111111E+00'
---
program P; const C = 1.111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111; begin Write(C) end.
